{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "languageId": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Exploring the bank",
        "",
        "Every code cell runs Robot Framework statements \u2014 keyword calls, variables, `FOR`, `IF` \u2014 in one live session.",
        "Run a cell with **Shift+Enter**. Select the kernel *Robot Framework REPL* if VS Code asks."
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "languageId": "robotframework-repl",
      "source": [
        "Import Library    bank.BankLibrary"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "languageId": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Your turn",
        "",
        "Open an account for `alice`, deposit some money and look at the balance."
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "languageId": "robotframework-repl",
      "source": [
        "Open Account    alice",
        "Deposit    alice    100",
        "Get Balance    alice"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "languageId": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Ten deposits"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "languageId": "robotframework-repl",
      "source": [
        "Open Account    carol",
        "FOR    ${i}    IN RANGE    10",
        "    Deposit    carol    10",
        "END",
        "Balance Should Be    carol    100"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "languageId": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## What I found out",
        "",
        "A checking account has an overdraft limit of **100** by default (`.kw Open Account`).",
        "With a balance of 70, withdrawing 170 is still allowed; 171 fails with *exceeds the limit*."
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  ]
}
